\caption{\label{fig:dynamics}Correlation dependence of entanglement extraction and teleportation for twelve spins. 
%Twenty labeled rows span $-1/11\le\xi\le1$, with denser sampling near collective noise; equal row spacing does not imply equal correlation spacing. 
